          "noteable_iid": 3350,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 603349854,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "-O3 gets enabled automatically with CMake build type Release. If we only add this flag for that build type, I think it will nicely prevent the warnings from being committed with RelWithDebInfo in case they show up (I don't remember seeing this warning ever with -O2), and not create the problem described above.",
